# new_world.tas — the "New World" entry of the Settings menu
# (REQ-VOXEL-035).
#
# Purpose: dig one block, then open the pause menu and select
# Settings > Tab: Game > New World. The demo deletes the saved edits and
# starts the world again from the seed. tests/save_reload.sh runs it with
# --save=on and checks that the save file is gone and that the next run
# has the terrain of the seed.
#
# Keys: Escape opens the pause menu (Resume selected). Down selects
# Settings, Enter opens it (the tab picker, Video). Left changes the tab to
# Game and selects New World. Enter starts the new world.
#
# Usage (from the repo root):
#   zig build native -Dexample=voxel
#   ./zig-out/bin/voxel --headless --world=flatland --save=on \
#     --tas examples/voxel/tests/new_world.tas

1 mouse_down left
2 mouse_up left
3 mouse_move 0 400
5 mouse_down left
6 mouse_up left

10 keydown Escape
11 keyup Escape
13 keydown Down
14 keyup Down
16 keydown Enter
17 keyup Enter
19 keydown Left
20 keyup Left
22 keydown Enter
23 keyup Enter

60 wait 1
